  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [instantsearch.js](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/) ([source](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js)) | dependencies | patch | [`3.5.1` -> `3.5.3`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/instantsearch.js/3.5.1/3.5.3) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>algolia/instantsearch.js</summary>\n\n### [`v3.5.3`](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;353httpsgithubcomalgoliainstantsearchjscomparev351v353-2019-05-28)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/compare/v3.5.2...v3.5.3)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **voiceSearch:** let the connector handle the default value of searchAsYouSpeak when it's not given ([#&#8203;3817](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/3817)) ([9d3e91b](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/commit/9d3e91b))\n-   **getTag:** use object version of toString ([#&#8203;3820](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/3820)) ([a7348ea](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/commit/a7348ea))\n-   **types:** fix cssClasses of voiceSearch ([#&#8203;3783](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/3783)) ([f016326](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/commit/f016326))\n\n### [`v3.5.2`](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/compare/v3.5.1...v3.5.2)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/compare/v3.5.1...v3.5.2)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://togithub.com/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
